      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:22:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Also, ReadOffsetFully doesn\u0027t return how much data is actually read.\n\nLike if it ever returns false, it means an I/O error or the file is malformed (it has inaccurate offsets in it), and we should stop. It should always read the full length for this algorithm.",
      "parentUuid": "8e65d231_f7bb25d3",
