    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "76a0a3a8_b074511d",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1956258
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:04:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "memcmp will need zero array for comparison which has allocation cost. something like this can be done but I don\u0027t think it is really readable.\n\n```\nstatic int memvcmp(void *memory, unsigned char val, unsigned int size)\n{\n    unsigned char *mm \u003d (unsigned char*)memory;\n    return (*mm \u003d\u003d val) \u0026\u0026 memcmp(mm, mm + 1, size - 1) \u003d\u003d 0;\n}\n\n```",
      "parentUuid": "d651c55a_934591ff",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 93,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8358bebc_35c89930",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:08:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a very famous way to use memcmp - everyone should know it, and leave a comment if not. Calling a lambda a few thousands times would be a big waste.",
      "parentUuid": "76a0a3a8_b074511d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 93,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3ffedb4f_53b0b6b0",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1710792
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e oh also - we should use memcmp here - it will be much much faster\n\n\n\nreally? did you test this? STL libraries are usually heavily optimized.",
      "parentUuid": "8358bebc_35c89930",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 93,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "60c63f12_0c194cef",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T23:19:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "no, but you think it will optimize this to the level of memcmp? I would be surprised",
      "parentUuid": "3ffedb4f_53b0b6b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 93,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f1ef50b9_0896de15",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 93,
      "author": {
        "id": 1710792
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T23:29:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "memcmp compares two memory regions, so there\u0027s 2 memory access per comparison. Versus STL compares a memory region with a compile time constant, and there\u0027s only 1 memory access per comparison. I don\u0027t think STL calls are going to be significantly slower. And readability matters as well.",
      "parentUuid": "60c63f12_0c194cef",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 93,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a27249b1_15aa332a",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
